Program Title: shopping_list

Description:
Stores an ArrayList of any number of String inputs from the user, counts them and includes a search function for the list.


Example Input/Output:

Type in your Shopping List(Type "done" to finish.):
milk
eggs
rice
shampoo
coffee
done

You have 5 items in your cart
- milk
- eggs
- rice
- shampoo
- coffee
Enter an item to search for: eggs
eggs found in your cart!
